msgid "Running Cosima"
msgstr "运行 Cosima"

msgid ""
"``Cosima`` runs the external MEGAlib simulator. ``RunConfig`` describes a ``Run`` block in a "
"source file and does not start a process. The wrapper does not install MEGAlib, ROOT, or Geant4."
msgstr "``Cosima`` 调用外部 MEGAlib 模拟器。``RunConfig`` 描述源文件中的 ``Run`` 块，不启动进程。本包不会安装 MEGAlib、ROOT 或 Geant4。"

msgid ""
"Prepare a small, known-working source file with one inline ``Run`` declaration and one "
"corresponding ``FileName`` directive. Its geometry and other input files must be available on the"
" machine running Cosima. Choose a short simulation for the first integration test. The bundled "
"source-file editing template contains installation-specific external paths and is not a portable "
"simulation fixture."
msgstr ""
"准备一个小型、已知可运行的源文件，包含一个内联 ``Run`` 声明和对应的 ``FileName`` 指令。geometry "
"及其他输入必须在执行机器上可用。首次集成验证应采用短模拟。本包附带的源文件编辑模板含特定安装的外部资源路径，不能直接当成可移植模拟测试数据。"

msgid "Looking up the API"
msgstr "查询 API"

msgid ""
"The :doc:`API reference <api/index>` provides signatures, parameter defaults and units, return "
"fields, and exception behavior. In Python or a Notebook, the same docstrings are available "
"without building the documentation:"
msgstr ":doc:`API 参考 <api/index>` 提供签名、参数默认值与单位、返回字段及异常行为。在 Python 或 notebook 中，无需构建文档也可以查看同一份 docstring："

msgid "Two runtime modes"
msgstr "两种运行模式"

msgid "When the current environment can already run Cosima:"
msgstr "当前环境已经能够运行 Cosima 时："

msgid ""
"When MEGAlib needs its own environment, initialize it inside a separate Bash process. That script"
" must establish the executable and library search paths. It may activate a different Conda "
"environment. The script must be trusted; loading it executes its Bash commands."
msgstr ""
"MEGAlib 需要独立环境时，在单独的 Bash 子进程中初始化。脚本需设置可执行文件和动态库搜索路径，也可以激活另一个 Conda 环境。请只加载可信脚本，因为加载会执行其中的 Bash "
"命令。"

msgid ""
"Both modes launch external processes. In setup-script mode, initialization and ``exec cosima`` "
"occur in the same child process. The parent Python environment and working directory are "
"unchanged. The numbered bootstrap is saved in the Cosima ``logs/`` directory and executed as a "
"script file, avoiding multiline ``bash -c`` arguments that can confuse shell detection in some "
"ROOT initialization scripts. Common inherited Python and library search-path variables are "
"removed before sourcing the script, but this is not a container or a guarantee of a hermetic "
"environment. The script must fully initialize the intended runtime. Do not source it into the "
"analysis shell before starting Python just to combine two Conda environments."
msgstr ""
"两种模式均启动外部进程。setup-script 模式在同一子进程中完成初始化与 ``exec cosima``，不修改父 Python 环境和工作目录。启动脚本按脚本文件执行，避免多行 "
"``bash -c`` 参数干扰部分 ROOT 初始化脚本的 shell 检测。source 前会清除常见继承的 Python "
"和动态库搜索变量，但这不是容器，也不保证完全隔离。脚本必须完整初始化目标运行环境。不要为了混用两个 Conda 环境，在启动分析 Python 前先向分析 shell source "
"MEGAlib。启动文件的当前临时保留规则见下文“精简记录”。"

msgid "Configuration and provenance"
msgstr "配置与来源记录"

msgid "Each experiment has exactly one Cosima execution, stored at:"
msgstr "每个实验恰好包含一次 Cosima 执行，目录如下："

msgid ""
"Both output_dir and workspace identify an experiment root. Cosima has no attempt subdirectory. "
"Repeating simulation, including after failure, requires a new workspace. Read a particular "
"command with result.record, not by treating the root manifest as a standalone execution. See "
":doc:`workspaces`."
msgstr ""
"output_dir 和 workspace 都表示实验根目录。Cosima 没有 attempt 子目录。任何重跑（包括失败重试）都需要新 workspace。通过 result.record"
" 读取特定命令，不要将根 manifest 当作单条执行记录。详见 :doc:`workspaces`。"

msgid ""
"The original source bytes are recorded in the manifest. In the temporary execution input, the "
"single ``FileName`` is redirected to ``products/events``. Comments and other directives are "
"retained. Supported relative geometry, orientation-file, and spectrum/beam file references are "
"rebased against the original source directory. Cosima runs with that original directory as its "
"working directory. Output-directory and rewritten configuration paths cannot contain whitespace "
"or ``$`` because the wrapper does not assume that Cosima's configuration parser supports quoting."
msgstr ""
"原始 source 字节保存在 manifest 中。临时执行输入中的唯一 ``FileName`` 被定向到 ``products/events``；注释和其他指令保留。受支持的相对 "
"geometry、orientation、spectrum/beam 引用按原 source 目录解析。Cosima 也以该原始目录为 cwd。输出目录和改写后的配置路径不能包含空白或 "
"``$``，因为本包不假设 Cosima 配置解析器支持引号转义。"

msgid ""
"The actual seed is always recorded, including when one is generated implicitly. "
"``compressed=False`` selects Cosima's ``-u`` option; otherwise the wrapper passes ``-z``. Output "
"discovery returns a tuple of files and does not assume ``inc1.id1``. Log streams go directly to "
"disk."
msgstr ""
"始终记录实际 seed，包括自动生成的 seed。``compressed=False`` 使用 Cosima 的 ``-u``，否则传 ``-z``。产物发现返回文件元组，不假定名称为 "
"``inc1.id1``。日志以流式方式写入磁盘。"

msgid ""
"The manifest records the command, timestamps, state, return code, package and Python versions, an"
" available local source revision and dirty flag, tool executable SHA-256, configuration "
"checksums, and dependency-capture scope. An executable checksum identifies the binary; it does "
"not identify every dynamic library or substitute for a complete ROOT/Geant4 build record. Native "
"tool version information printed by an initialization script is preserved in logs."
msgstr ""
"manifest 记录命令、时间戳、状态、返回码、包及 Python 版本、可取得的本地源码 revision 与 dirty 状态、工具可执行文件 "
"SHA-256、配置校验和及依赖捕获范围。二进制校验和不能标识全部动态库，也不能替代完整 ROOT/Geant4 构建记录。初始化脚本打印的原生工具版本保存在日志中。"

msgid ""
"The setup script is recorded by original path and hash and sourced from that location, preserving"
" scripts that locate resources using BASH_SOURCE. There is no separate setup.sh file in the "
"workspace. Keep it and external inputs unchanged during execution."
msgstr ""
"记录 setup 脚本的原路径和 hash，并始终从该位置 source，从而保留基于 BASH_SOURCE 的资源查找行为。workspace 内没有独立 setup.sh "
"备份。执行期间请保持该脚本和外部输入不变。"

msgid "Additional external files can be declared explicitly:"
msgstr "可以显式声明额外外部文件："

msgid ""
"The default hash limit is zero: nonempty resources are recorded by path, size and mtime without "
"being read or copied. Explicit hash_limit_bytes enables hashing; copying additionally requires "
"runtime.archive_inputs=True. Manifest and snapshot files may contain private paths and "
"configuration: keep execution directories outside the public repository and review them before "
"sharing."
msgstr ""
"默认 hash 上限为零：非空资源只记录路径、大小和 mtime，不读取或复制。显式 hash_limit_bytes 启用 hash；复制还需要 "
"runtime.archive_inputs=True。manifest 和快照可能含私有路径与配置，请将执行目录放在公开仓库之外，并在分享前检查。"

msgid "First-version limits"
msgstr "当前版本限制"

msgid ""
"One inline run, ordinary event simulation. Source ``Include`` directives and activation/cross-"
"section jobs are rejected. See the separate Revan and Mimrec guides for reconstruction and "
"analysis."
msgstr ""
"支持一个内联 run 的普通事件模拟。拒绝 source 的 ``Include`` 指令以及 activation/cross-section 作业。重建与分析分别见 Revan 和 "
"Mimrec 指南。"

msgid ""
"Dependency capture is explicitly incomplete: nested geometry include trees, arbitrary file-valued"
" directives, and runtime-expanded paths are not automatically archived. External data is still "
"read from its original location. Preserve those resources independently."
msgstr "依赖捕获并不完整：嵌套 geometry include 树、任意文件值指令和运行时展开的路径不会自动归档。外部数据仍从原位置读取，请独立保存这些资源。"

msgid ""
"Existing execution directories are never overwritten or automatically reused. There is no "
"resume/cache implementation yet."
msgstr "不会覆盖或自动复用既有执行目录；尚未提供 resume/cache。"

msgid ""
"Success requires exit status zero and nonempty simulation files. This does not establish event "
"counts, physical correctness, or complete gzip integrity."
msgstr "成功要求退出码为零且模拟文件非空；这不证明事件数、物理正确性或完整 gzip 完整性。"

msgid ""
"Local stand-in-tool tests exercise subprocess behavior; only a real MEGAlib run on the target "
"installation establishes native integration compatibility."
msgstr "本地替代工具测试验证子进程行为，目标安装上的真实 MEGAlib 执行才能验证原生集成兼容性。"

msgid "Failures and timeouts"
msgstr "失败与超时"

msgid ""
"Preparation errors, nonzero exit status, missing output, and timeouts are recorded in the "
"manifest. A setup script must return a nonzero status when its initialization fails; a final "
"successful ``echo`` can otherwise hide an earlier failure. The wrapper does not treat every "
"stderr message as fatal. Inspect initialization logs as well as the manifest when validating a "
"new runtime. On timeout or keyboard interruption the process group is terminated, including "
"ordinary child processes. A forcibly killed Python process can leave ``preparing`` or ``running``"
" in its manifest; these states must never be treated as completed executions."
msgstr ""
"准备错误、非零退出、缺少输出和超时都会写入 manifest。setup 脚本初始化失败时必须返回非零状态，否则末尾成功的 ``echo`` 可能掩盖先前错误。本包不将所有 stderr "
"消息视为致命错误；验证新 runtime 时需同时检查初始化日志和 manifest。超时或键盘中断会终止进程组及普通子进程。强制终止 Python 可能留下 ``preparing`` 或 "
"``running`` 状态，不能将这些记录当作已完成。"

msgid "Command-line example"
msgstr "命令行示例"

msgid ""
"The repository includes ``examples/cosima_simulation.py``. Run it from the repository root with a"
" short source file and a new output path:"
msgstr "仓库提供 ``examples/cosima_simulation.py``。在仓库根目录使用短 source 和新输出路径运行："

msgid "Add ``--setup-script ~/initialize-megalib.sh`` for the separate-runtime mode."
msgstr "独立运行环境模式需添加 ``--setup-script ~/initialize-megalib.sh``。"

msgid "Execution identity and upstream records"
msgstr "执行身份与上游记录"

msgid ""
"The root workspace manifest stores independent execution records with UUIDs. Use "
"result.execution_id and result.record to select the particular command. Cosima has no upstream "
"execution; later native operations retain its exact ID and selected sim files. Same-workspace "
"lineage uses ID links without copying manifests; external selected records are snapshotted. "
"Legacy schema-1 standalone records remain readable, including records without an execution ID. "
"See :doc:`workspaces` for group selection and compatibility."
msgstr ""
"根 manifest 以 UUID 保存独立执行记录。通过 result.execution_id 和 result.record 指定命令。Cosima 没有上游执行；后续操作保留其精确 ID"
" 和选定 sim 文件。同 workspace 通过 ID 关联，不复制 manifest；外部输入只快照选定记录。旧 schema-1 独立记录仍可读，包括没有 execution ID "
"的记录。组选择与兼容性见 :doc:`workspaces`。"

msgid "Compact recording"
msgstr "精简记录"

msgid ""
"See :doc:`workspaces` for the default manifest-based source/config retention, temporary native "
"inputs and launch helpers, optional archival mode and keyword-based summary capture. Empty logs "
"are removed and their result paths are None. A physical configuration snapshot is retained only "
"when runtime.archive_inputs is true."
msgstr ""
"默认的 manifest 内 source/cfg 保留、临时原生输入和启动文件、可选归档以及关键词摘要捕获见 :doc:`workspaces`。空日志被删除，其结果路径为 None。仅 "
"runtime.archive_inputs 为 true 时才保留实体配置快照。"
